WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.979 --> 00:00:20.786
The treemap nests people inside companies inside circles. Box size is relationship strength, so the biggest boxes are your closest people.

2
00:00:20.786 --> 00:00:29.151
Click a circle or company to zoom in, and use the breadcrumb to go back.

3
00:00:29.151 --> 00:00:37.433
The radial tree is the same hierarchy as a dendrogram: you in the centre, then circles, then companies, then people on the outer ring.

4
00:00:37.433 --> 00:00:44.410
In large networks the outer names appear on hover, and clicking a person opens their sheet.

5
00:00:44.410 --> 00:00:52.605
Activity charts your interactions per month over the last two years, straight from imported email threads and anything you log by hand.

6
00:00:52.605 --> 00:00:59.851
The strength distribution shows how many people sit at each level, and the heat map shows which sources feed each circle.

7
00:00:59.851 --> 00:01:05.024
All of these views share the same filters at the top: lens, source and search.
